  { n: '02', h: 'Market Survival Audit', p: 'Our practical fit check filters every career option through Interest, Market, and Scalability. One wrong skill choice can waste 2–3 years. This checkpoint removes guesswork.', out: 'Your Skill Stack Blueprint' },
  { n: '03', h: 'Communication & Proof', p: 'Skills alone don’t pay. We build your proof system — portfolio, positioning, outreach — so the right people find you and hire you before you have to ask.', out: 'Your Proof of Value System' },
  { n: '04', h: 'Future-Ready Matrix', p: 'Your Freedom Number, your AI-proof score, and your compounding plan. This is where everything clicks and income becomes a decision, not luck.', out: 'Your Income Roadmap' },
