---

<BaseLayout
  title="Career Guidance for Every Growth Stage | Future Career School"
  description="Practical career counselling for students, freshers, and professionals: free assessments, high-value skill direction, and a roadmap toward earlier financial freedom."
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://images.unsplash.com" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Instrument+Serif:ital@0;1&family=Manrope:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" />

  <div class="lv">
    <Nav />
    <div class="rail" aria-hidden="true"><i id="rail"></i></div>

    <main>
      <!-- ══════ 01 · CINEMATIC HERO ══════ -->
      <section class="stage" id="hero">
        <div class="stage-media" aria-hidden="true">
          <img class="kb" src={IMG.hero} alt="" width="1900" height="1100" fetchpriority="high" />
          <span class="scrim"></span>
          <span class="grain"></span>
        </div>

        <div class="stage-in wrap">
          <p class="over l"><span>Career counselling &amp; career guidance — fully online, across India</span></p>
          <h1 class="disp disp-hero">
            <span class="l"><span>The next ten years</span></span>
            <span class="l"><span>of your life are decided</span></span>
            <span class="l"><span>by <em>one</em> decision.</span></span>
          </h1>
          <p class="stage-p l"><span>Which skill you commit to — and whether anyone will pay a premium for it. We help students, freshers and working professionals get that decision right, then execute it toward earlier financial freedom.</span></p>
          <div class="stage-cta l">
            <span>
              <a href="/services/career-counselling-and-career-guidance" class="bt bt-solid">Get Career Guidance<i aria-hidden="true">→</i></a>
              <a href="/services/assessments" class="bt bt-glass">Free Career &amp; Skill Assessments</a>
            </span>
          </div>
          <ul class="stage-tr l"><span>
            <li><b>10,000+</b> guided</li>
            <li><b>4.9/5</b> average rating</li>
            <li><b>Free</b> assessments &amp; tools</li>
            <li><b>No</b> fake job guarantees</li>
          </span></ul>
        </div>

        <div class="cue" aria-hidden="true"><i></i>Scroll</div>
      </section>

      <!-- ══════ 02 · STATEMENT ══════ -->
